'use client';import {ArrowDownRight,ArrowUpRight,TrendingUp,LockKeyhole} from 'lucide-react';import {money} from '@/lib/data';import {useStore} from '@/lib/store';import Kpi from '@/components/Kpi';import {Panel,Toolbar} from '@/components/Panel';
export default function Expenses(){const{bills,products,role}=useStore();if(role!=='admin')return <Panel><h3>Access restricted</h3><p className="empty">Expenses and profit are available only to Admin.</p></Panel>;const sales=bills.reduce((s,b)=>s+b.subtotal,0),expense=bills.reduce((s,b)=>s+b.expense,0),profit=sales-expense;return <><Toolbar title="Expenses & Profit" subtitle="Private accounting section — Admin only"><span className="admin-tag"><LockKeyhole size={12}/> ADMIN ONLY</span></Toolbar><div className="kpis three"><Kpi title="Total Sales" value={money(sales)} note="Completed bills" icon={<ArrowUpRight/>}/><Kpi title="Total Expense" value={money(expense)} note="Product costs" icon={<ArrowDownRight/>}/><Kpi title="Total Profit" value={money(profit)} note="Sales − expense" icon={<TrendingUp/>}/></div><div className="dash-grid"><Panel><h3>Profit by Product</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Sales Qty</th><th>Sales</th><th>Expense</th><th>Profit</th></tr></thead><tbody>{products.map(p=>{let q=0,s=0,e=0;bills.forEach(b=>b.items.forEach(i=>{if(i.productId===p.id){q+=i.qty;s+=i.total;e+=i.expense*i.qty}}));return <tr key={p.id}><td>{p.name}</td><td>{q}</td><td>{money(s)}</td><td>{money(e)}</td><td><b>{money(s-e)}</b></td></tr>})}</tbody></table></Panel><Panel className="profit-card"><h3>Net Profit</h3><div className="big-profit">{money(profit)}<small>After product expenses</small></div><div className="privacy">🔒 Expense and profit values are visible only to Admin; staff and customer receipts show total amount only.</div></Panel></div></>}
